.docname {SH2SC-EDT and C2P-ARQ: A Self-Healing Hardware and Software Complex Utilizing the ChaCha20-Poly1305 Automatic Repeat reQuest Protocol}
.docdescription {A paper about SH2SC-EDT and the C2P-ARQ protocol for fault-tolerant encrypted data transmission on ATmega328P hardware.}
